---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "@/components/Navbar";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer";
import { siteConfig } from "@/config/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${siteConfig.shortName}`}
  description={`Privacy Policy for ${siteConfig.shortName} AI Video Editor (${siteConfig.domain}). Learn how we handle your data, media content, and user privacy.`}
>
  <Navbar client:load />

  <main class="pt-[110px] pb-20 sm:pt-[130px] sm:pb-28">
    <div class="container-x max-w-4xl">
      <!-- Back Link -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black/60 transition-colors hover:text-black"
        >
          <svg
            width="14"
            height="14"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.5"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M19 12H5"></path>
            <path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
          </svg>
          Back to Zera Studio
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="mb-12 border-b border-black/10 pb-8">
        <span class="eyebrow block mb-3">Legal & Privacy</span>
        <h1 class="text-3.5xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-black leading-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-black/60">
          <span>Effective Date: August 11, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Application Package: <code class="bg-bone px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-black">com.zerastudio.app</code></span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Content -->
      <article class="space-y-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-relaxed text-black/80">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">1. Overview & Scope</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy applies to {siteConfig.shortName} ("we," "our," or "us"), including the {siteConfig.shortName} mobile application for Android (Package ID: <code class="bg-bone px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono text-black font-semibold">com.zerastudio.app</code>) and our official website located at <a href={siteConfig.url} class="text-plum font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">{siteConfig.domain}</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            We respect user privacy and aim to maintain clear, transparent practices regarding what information is collected, how it is processed for AI video editing, and how you can exercise your data rights.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>Depending on your interaction with {siteConfig.shortName}, we collect data in the following categories:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Email address, authentication tokens, user ID, and account profile details when you sign up or log in to the mobile application.</li>
            <li><strong>User Content & Media:</strong> Video clips, audio tracks, images, and text prompts selected or uploaded by you within the app solely to enable AI video editing and timeline creation.</li>
            <li><strong>Device & Operational Metrics:</strong> Technical device identifiers (such as device model, OS version, app version, and language) and diagnostic logs (such as error reports and editing performance metrics) to maintain app stability.</li>
            <li><strong>Website Submissions:</strong> If you voluntarily submit feedback via the website feedback form, we process your submitted name, email address (optional), and feedback comments (hosted via Netlify Forms).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
          <p>We process collected data exclusively for the following operational purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Video Editing & AI Assembly:</strong> To analyze uploaded footage, detect scenes/cuts, perform automated editing transitions, and generate final video renders.</li>
            <li><strong>Account & Service Authentication:</strong> To maintain secure user sessions, manage beta access, and sync project states to your account.</li>
            <li><strong>Application Maintenance:</strong> To identify technical bugs, resolve crash reports, and optimize rendering speed.</li>
            <li><strong>User Support:</strong> To respond to support requests or inquiries sent to <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.generalEmail}`} class="text-plum font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">{siteConfig.generalEmail}</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">4. AI Processing & Third-Party Infrastructure</h2>
          <p>
            {siteConfig.shortName} utilizes cloud infrastructure and machine learning processing services to deliver AI video editing capabilities:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Data Transmission:</strong> All data exchanged between the app, web client, and processing services is encrypted in transit using standard HTTPS/TLS protocols.</li>
            <li><strong>Third-Party Processing:</strong> Data and media processing tasks are handled using cloud service providers bound by contractual confidentiality and privacy obligations. Website form submissions are processed securely via Netlify Forms.</li>
            <li><strong>No Data Monetization:</strong> We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal information or private video media to advertisers, data brokers, or third parties.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">5. Data Retention & Storage</h2>
          <p>
            Media assets and user content uploaded for AI video rendering are processed for the purpose of generating your requested video edits. Temporary buffer files created during rendering sessions are discarded upon completion of processing. Account data and project metadata are retained while your account remains active.
          </p>
          <p>
            Upon account deletion, your account record and associated user data are removed from our active database in accordance with our <a href="/account-deletion" class="text-plum font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">Account Deletion Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">6. Data Security</h2>
          <p>
            We employ standard administrative and technical safeguards—including encrypted transport layers (HTTPS/TLS) and restricted administrative access—to protect user information against unauthorized access, loss, or disclosure.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">7. Your Choices & Account Deletion</h2>
          <p>You have the right to inspect, update, or request deletion of your account and personal data:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>In-App Deletion:</strong> You can initiate account deletion directly within the mobile application settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Web Request:</strong> You can request manual account deletion via email or by following the instructions on our <a href="/account-deletion" class="text-plum font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">Account Deletion Page</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            {siteConfig.shortName} is not intended for children under 13 years of age (or under 16 where required by local law). We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please notify us at <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.generalEmail}`} class="text-plum font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80">{siteConfig.generalEmail}</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">9. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any revisions will be published on this page with an updated Effective Date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-black/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-black tracking-tight">10. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy inquiries, account deletion requests, or support, please contact:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-bone p-5 rounded-lg border border-black/10">
            <p class="font-bold text-black">{siteConfig.shortName} Support</p>
            <p class="mt-1">Website: <a href={siteConfig.url} class="text-plum font-medium hover:underline">{siteConfig.domain}</a></p>
            <p class="mt-1">Support Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.generalEmail}`} class="text-plum font-medium hover:underline">{siteConfig.generalEmail}</a></p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-black/60">Feedback Email: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.feedbackEmail}`} class="text-plum font-medium hover:underline">{siteConfig.feedbackEmail}</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
